================================================================================
ALL DEPENDENCIES EXPLAINED
================================================================================

MUST HAVE:
  None! Python 3.7+ is all you need to start.

RECOMMENDED (for reading attachments):
  - python-docx   → Read .docx (Word) files
  - openpyxl      → Read .xlsx (Excel) files  
  - pandas        → Read .csv files (better Excel too)
  - pywin32       → Access Outlook directly (Windows only)

INSTALL ALL:
  pip install pywin32 python-docx openpyxl pandas

INSTALL MINIMAL (csv/text only):
  pip install pandas

