STEP-BY-STEP: OPTION A (Simple Outlook Search)
================================================================================

1. INSTALL DEPENDENCIES
   Open command prompt/terminal and run:
   
   pip install pywin32 python-docx openpyxl pandas

2. POST-INSTALL PYWIN32 (Windows Only)
   Run in Windows Admin Command Prompt:
   
   python Scripts/pywin32_postinstall.py -install

3. OPEN OUTLOOK
   Make sure Outlook desktop app is running and logged in

4. RUN THE SCRIPT
   python outlook_search_simple.py

5. FOLLOW PROMPTS
   - Enter email filter (optional)
   - View found attachments
   - Enter search keywords
   - Review results

