================================================================================
COMMON PROBLEMS & FIXES
================================================================================

PROBLEM: "ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'win32com'"
FIX:     pip install pywin32
         python Scripts/pywin32_postinstall.py -install

PROBLEM: "Outlook application not found"
FIX:     Open Outlook desktop app first, make sure you're logged in

PROBLEM: "No files found"
FIX:     Check your emails actually have attachments
         Try without email filter (leave blank)

PROBLEM: "PermissionError"
FIX:     Run Python as Administrator
         Close Outlook if using PST file

PROBLEM: Script is slow
FIX:     Normal for first run with 1000+ emails
         Use email filter keyword to narrow search

PROBLEM: "WARNING: python-docx not installed"
FIX:     Install it: pip install python-docx
         It's optional but recommended

================================================================================
SUPPORTED FILE TYPES
================================================================================

SUPPORTED:
  .txt   → Plain text files
  .csv   → Comma-separated values (requires pandas for best results)
  .xlsx  → Excel files (requires openpyxl)
  .xls   → Older Excel files (requires openpyxl)
  .docx  → Word documents (requires python-docx)

NOT SUPPORTED:
  .pdf, .jpg, .png, .zip, etc.

Missing a library? Script will skip that file type and warn you.

